      "content": "but that's the thing... i'm not just tired. i've tried everything. therapy, meds, talking... it's like i'm a shattered glass and no matter how much glue i use, the cracks are still there. some things just can't be put back together. i feel like i'm just wasting time trying to \"fix\" something that's just... gone.",
